-- EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §11.0.2: the IN clause is the LIST the group is
-- drawn from, so it must be a list, and a list of the party type. A number is
-- neither; a list of strings is a list of the wrong thing.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`roll is a number` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t IN 42 MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) WITHIN 14

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`roll is a list of the wrong thing` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t IN (LIST "Alice") MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) WITHIN 14
